.TH APT 1 "2026-11-17" "apt-n900 0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
apt, apt\-tui \- friendly front end of apt-get for the Nokia N900
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B apt
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.br
.B apt tui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B apt
adds the commands of the modern
.BR apt (8)
to Maemo 5, whose apt is version 0.7. It only calls
.BR apt\-get (8),
.BR apt\-cache (8)
and
.BR dpkg\-query (1):
nothing of the system package manager is replaced.
.PP
Commands that change the system run through
.BR sudo (8)
when you are not root. Other options are passed to
.BR apt\-get :
for example
.B apt install \-y
.I package
or
.B apt upgrade \-s
(only simulate).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B update
Refresh the package lists.
.TP
.BR list " [" \-\-upgradable | \-\-installed "] [" \fIpattern\fR ]
List packages; with no option, the packages that can be upgraded.
.TP
.B tui
Text-mode package manager built on
.BR dialog (1):
upgrade, search, install and remove from a menu. Also installed as
.BR apt\-tui .
.TP
.B upgrade
Install the available upgrades; asks first.
.TP
.B full\-upgrade
The same, but may install or remove packages (apt-get dist-upgrade).
.TP
.BI install " package" ...
Install packages.
.TP
.BI remove " package" ...
Remove packages and keep their configuration files.
.TP
.BI purge " package" ...
Remove packages and their configuration files.
.TP
.B autoremove
Remove packages that are no longer needed.
.TP
.B clean
Delete the downloaded
.B .deb
files.
.TP
.BI search " words"
Search package names and descriptions.
.TP
.BI show " package"
Show the details of a package.
.TP
.RB "policy [" \fIpackage\fR ]
Show the available versions and the repositories they come from.
.TP
.BI files " package"
List the files of an installed package.
.TP
.BI owns " file"
Find the installed package that owns
.IR file .
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a short help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list, /etc/apt/sources.list.d/
the sources that
.B apt update
reads.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apt\-get (8),
.BR apt\-cache (8),
.BR dpkg (1),
.BR dialog (1),
.BR n900 (7)
